WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.027
Welcome to Module 7 of the
Privileged Access learning path:

2
00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:06.462
access reviews of privileged roles.

3
00:00:06.462 --> 00:00:12.976
This module serves the project plan's
task A2.7 in Phase 2 and A3.7 in Phase 3,

4
00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:16.775
with Chapter 07 of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:16.775 --> 00:00:19.762
The approval gate controls
the use of privilege.

6
00:00:19.762 --> 00:00:22.712
Reviews control who keeps the eligibility.

7
00:00:22.712 --> 00:00:28.093
The program's design creates one recurring
review per role, Tier 0 monthly and the

8
00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:33.474
rest quarterly, with auto-apply on, and
remove access when reviewers don't respond.

9
00:00:33.474 --> 00:00:37.700
In this module you define every
privileged review series as code.

10
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.782
You show a reviewer what a change
will do before it reaches the tenant,

11
00:00:41.782 --> 00:00:44.361
apply it with the least
permission that can,

12
00:00:44.361 --> 00:00:47.512
and hand the ISSO the
decisions each review produced.

13
00:00:47.512 --> 00:00:51.940
The code is illustrative: tested
against fixtures and a fake.
